# M4 — Google Maps native SDK key (Android).
#
# Copy this file to `android/secrets.properties` (git-ignored) and set your
# Android-restricted Maps SDK key. When the real file is absent, the build
# defaults MAPS_API_KEY to "" and the app ships "dark" (no Google map; the
# googleNavEnabled capability flag is false).
#
# This key is restricted to the app's package + signing certificate in the
# Google Cloud console — it is the SDK (native) key, NOT the Routes key
# (Routes keys are passed at build time via --dart-define).
MAPS_API_KEY=
